 "kind": "definition",
 "title": "Bounded below derived lower shriek of module objects",
 "statement": "Let $\\Lambda$ be a commutative condensed ring and $f\\colon X\\to Y$ a morphism of\nschemes admitting a compactification. The *bounded below derived lower shriek*\n\n$$\nR^+f_!\\colon D^+(\\Mod_{\\Lambda_X})\\to D^+(\\Mod_{\\Lambda_Y})\n$$\n\nis the functor $R^+f^c_!=R^+g_*\\circ D^+(i_!)$ of\n[def-sfb-module-derived-lower-shriek-compactification-plus] for the chosen\ncompactification $c$ of $f$.",
 "source": {
